UID:d0de28838a9957260cf826f7b05d806b8312026_11:52:52_AM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:UPStart
LOCATION:53 Wall Street Black Box Theater, 53 Wall Street, New Haven, CT 06520, United States
URL:https://yaleconnect.yale.edu/rsvp?id=2328337
DESCRIPTION:Want to be a theatre maker at Yale? Then UPStart is the perfect workshop for you. The Office of Undergraduate Production invites you to learn about how to produce and direct your own shows, apply for funding, operate basic theatrical equipment, and meet the Peer Mentors. More information about our office and the peer mentor program can be found here.\nhttps://up.yalecollege.yale.edu/resources/peer-mentor-program\n---\nEvent Details: https://yaleconnect.yale.edu/rsvp?id=2328337
END:VEVENT
