UID:03df5c740ccb55fa8bea320200ac587d9212026_12:55:11_PM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:Archiving Your Student Organization’s Records | A Lunchtime Workshop
LOCATION:Sterling Memorial Library, International Room
URL:https://yaleconnect.yale.edu/rsvp?id=2332067
DESCRIPTION:Join University Archivist Mike Lotstein on Wednesday, October 7,\nto learn about archiving your student organization’s records. \n\nMike will review how to select, prepare, and transfer your student\norganization’s records to the University Archives and provide an\noverview of best practices to maintain and preserve your analog and digital archives within your organization.\n\nLunch will be provided\n\nRSVP to archives@yale.edu by 5 PM on Friday, October 2, 2026\n\n---\nEvent Details: https://yaleconnect.yale.edu/rsvp?id=2332067
END:VEVENT
