UID:da20709cb7f65e703828aa776da5b52e1032026_1:54:50_PM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:DPops: Brand New Day
LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://yaleconnect.yale.edu/rsvp?id=2334418
DESCRIPTION:DPops is so excited to welcome you to our first concert of the 2026-2027 school year: DPops: Brand New Day! Our music will feature music from Project Hail Mary, Spider Man, Billy Joel, Ace Attourney, Your Name, Enhypen, and Olivia Rodrigo! Join us for a night of music, dance, and maybe even a trip to the underworld…\n\nThe concert starts at 9pm in the Davenport Dining Hall. To attend the in-person concert, you must register for a ticket through Eventbrite. We are happy to announce that people not affiliated with Yale may also attend.\n\nDoors open at 8:45pm on Friday, 10/16. Please be prepared to show your ID. We hope to see you there!\n\nIf you can’t snag a ticket in time, or if you have friends/family who can’t attend, we’ll also be livestreaming the concert on our YouTube channel!\n---\nEvent Details: https://yaleconnect.yale.edu/rsvp?id=2334418
END:VEVENT
