UID:86776619662b72386180d16483ed00ca1052026_6:16:36_PM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:Solaris hosts a Halloween Night, with The Fortune Teller
LOCATION:Crescent Theater
URL:https://yaleconnect.yale.edu/rsvp?id=2334694
DESCRIPTION:We're Solaris, a 5-person instrumental group from the Yale School of Music, hosting a tarot card-themed halloween night with FREE FOOD, pastries, drinks, original music, and a secret interactive event that lets YOU decide how we perform the music! 👻\nYou don't want to miss this event - we're hosting in Ezra Stiles' Crescent Theatre on Thursday, Oct 15, and there will be secret prizes for our lucky winners after the concert and social hour! Bring a friend, come for the food and drinks, stay for the music and games!\n---\nEvent Details: https://yaleconnect.yale.edu/rsvp?id=2334694
END:VEVENT
