SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:Iphis & Ianthe
LOCATION:-
URL:https://yaleconnect.yale.edu/rsvp?id=2335764
DESCRIPTION:Loosely based on a myth from Ovid’s Metamorphoses, Iphis and Ianthe is a queer rom-com about literature, gender, and studying for finals. This original one-act runs about 30 minutes.\n---\nEvent Details: https://yaleconnect.yale.edu/rsvp?id=2335764
END:VEVENT
