UID:689ba124dd083d6f3c61553fdddf53a610132026_4:26:21_PM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:in another life - an evening with Marin Clarisse
LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://yaleconnect.yale.edu/rsvp?id=2335881
DESCRIPTION:Join Marin Clarisse for an intimate evening of music in Trumbull College’s Nick Chapel Theater, celebrating the release of her second EP. \n\nFive songs, a piano, and a string quartet, performed by candlelight. This is a small, quiet room built for close listening, with songs that sit somewhere between chamber music and singer-songwriter intimacy.\n\nThe concert is supported by Trumbull College’s Creative and Performing Arts (CPA) award and presented with 17o1 Records, Yale’s student-run record label.\n---\nEvent Details: https://yaleconnect.yale.edu/rsvp?id=2335881
END:VEVENT
