UID:ccab0ee58ee52f29072968264f404c251162026_5:33:17_PM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:Much Ado About Nothing
LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://yaleconnect.yale.edu/rsvp?id=2338367
DESCRIPTION:When the “skirmish of wit” between rivals Beatrice and Benedick becomes too much for their friends to bear, a plan is hatched to bring them into “a mountain of affection, th’ one with th’ other.” Meanwhile, the passionate romance between Beatrice’s cousin Hero and Benedick’s best friend Claudio seems to be blooming too quickly for others’ tastes. As dark schemes unfold and unexpected romances blossom, not everything in Messina is quite as it seems… and summer isn’t over yet.\n\nWith some of the most beautiful love poetry ever written, the best witty insults, and hilarious comics in the form of the ineffectual night watchmen, Much Ado About Nothing is the OG enemies-to-lovers romcom: truly Shakespeare at his best.\n\nFor all inquiries, please contact: \nrishi.sultana@yale.edu\n---\nEvent Details: https://yaleconnect.yale.edu/rsvp?id=2338367
END:VEVENT
